### Upload a document (multipart)
POST https://localhost:60517/v1/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----documents-boundary

------documents-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

general
------documents-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ownerId"

00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
------documents-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello from the Documents service!
------documents-boundary--

### Get document metadata
GET https://localhost:60517/v1/{{documentId}}

### Download document content
GET https://localhost:60517/v1/download/{{documentId}}

### List documents by category
GET https://localhost:60517/v1/category/general

### Delete (soft-delete) a document
DELETE https://localhost:60517/v1/{{documentId}}

### Healthcheck
GET https://localhost:60517/v1/ping
